%% Capability writes are provisional until every dependent future schedule validates.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Center Manager
    participant UI as ManagerRooms
    participant API as Express / operationHandlers
    participant V as validateResources
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL
    A->>UI: Save room equipment quantities
    UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/rooms/:id/capabilities
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorize(ADMIN, MANAGER), validate request
    alt request rejected
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403
    else request accepted
        API->>DB: Begin transaction, lock room and find room
        DB-->>API: Room or missing record
        alt room missing
            API->>DB: Roll back transaction
            API-->>UI: 404 room not found
        else room exists
            API->>DB: Provisionally replace RoomCapability rows and read future schedules
            DB-->>API: Dependent future schedules
            API->>V: validateResources(tx, each dependent session)
            activate V
            V->>DB: Read class requirements, room capabilities, Coach expertise and leave
            DB-->>V: Resource constraints
            V-->>API: All valid or first validation error
            deactivate V
            alt any dependent session invalid
                API->>DB: Roll back provisional capability writes
                API-->>UI: Resource validation error
            else all dependent sessions valid
                API->>DB: Commit capabilities
                API-->>UI: 200 updated room and capabilities
            end
        end
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show updated equipment or rejection

%% Request validation schemas (see route evidence): quantities
